<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2131_7987.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frundtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear> und was wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoeggend</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>. Edle, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fromme</unclear>, Veste,
<lb n="3"/>Fürsichtige, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehrsanne</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wyse</unclear>, insonders guote Fründt
<lb n="4"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> liebe <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nachparenn</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Das</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">von</unclear> üch und unß, wegen zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syets</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorstender</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">capijetels</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">buwen</unclear>, ist <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tag</unclear> den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgeordenten</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesantten</unclear>. gen <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-8" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Appenzell</placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverreysßen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angestelt</unclear> worden
<lb n="8"/>das den uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mornn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschähen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Da</unclear> aber uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dyß</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mahlen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ettwas</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nothwendige</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gschäfft</unclear> by uns
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ingerysßen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Allso</unclear> das. (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyllen</unclear> unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alter</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>landtaman <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cuorath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zällwegger</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwelt</unclear>.) nicht
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müglichen</unclear> sin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wirt</unclear> durch den selbigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>richten. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Deß</unclear> wegen wir üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pijttend</unclear>.
<lb n="14"/>wellend uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffschub</unclear> nicht zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bössem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halten</unclear>.
<lb n="15"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">annemen</unclear>, sonder guoter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollmeinung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstohn</unclear>,.
<lb n="16"/>damit es aber uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glegenheijt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vollsterckt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>.
<lb n="17"/>wellend wir (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gliebts</unclear> gott.) uff <date resp="#ner">nechst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">künfftigen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>sambstag</date>. üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> meinung vermelden. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thuend</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>hiemit üch und uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gottes</unclear> schirm und gnad <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woll</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevohlen</unclear> datum <origDate when="1619" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">26</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iste</unclear> tag <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maij</unclear> Anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1619</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="21"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-565" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Landtaman und Rath der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usßeren</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Roden</unclear>. deß Landts Appenzell</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2131_7988.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2131_7989.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2131_7990.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="23"/>Den edlen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vesten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear>, ersamen
<lb n="24"/>und weysen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Raht der stadt
<lb n="25"/>Sanct Gallen</orgName>. unseren insonders gueten fruenden
<lb n="26"/>und getruewen lieben nachpauren.
</p>
